  #line-at(287.445pt, 67.44pt, "). As discussed in Section 2, these individual parameters ")
  #line-at(56.88pt, 93.12pt, "combine to form 13 key parameters that primarily govern the heat diffusion process in the SOI sample, as shown ")
  #line-at(56.88pt, 118.32pt, "in Fig. 2(c). For clarity, these combined parameters are labeled with double-digit circled numbers, where the first ")
  #line-at(56.88pt, 143.52pt, "digit represents the layer number and the second indicates the parameter’s sequence within that layer. ")
