  #line-at(56.88pt, 92.4pt, "layer exists at the Al/Si interface due to the absence of hydrofluoric acid (HF) cleaning before Al deposition ")
  #line-at(56.88pt, 117.84pt, "on the SOI substrate. This interfacial oxide introduces additional phonon scattering mechanisms and thermal ")
  #line-at(56.88pt, 143.04pt, "resistance not accounted for by the DMM, thereby limiting the model’s quantitative accuracy in describing ")
  #line-at(56.88pt, 168.48pt, "real-world systems. ")
  #line-at(78.88pt, 193.68pt, "In the literature, similar SOI structures were previously studied by Jiang et al. [28, 29] using TDTR to ")
